20: Class `Symfony\Component\Translation\Extractor\PhpExtractor` is removed: use `Symfony\Component\Translation\Extractor\PhpAstExtractor`, which parses the code with `nikic/php-parser` and takes its visitors in the constructor, since symfony/translation 6.2.
29: Class `Symfony\Component\Translation\Extractor\PhpStringTokenParser` is removed: there is no replacement; the token based extractor is gone; parse the code with `nikic/php-parser`, since symfony/translation 6.2.
38: Method `Symfony\Component\Translation\Loader\CsvFileLoader::setCsvControl()` is replaced by `setCsvControl($delimiter, $enclosure)`.
48: Method `Symfony\Component\Translation\Loader\CsvFileLoader::setCsvControl()` is replaced by `setCsvControl($delimiter, $enclosure)`.
50: Method `Symfony\Component\Translation\Loader\CsvFileLoader::setCsvControl()` is replaced by `setCsvControl()`.
51: Method `Symfony\Component\Translation\Loader\CsvFileLoader::setCsvControl()` is replaced by `setCsvControl($delimiter)`.
52: Method `Symfony\Component\Translation\Loader\CsvFileLoader::setCsvControl()` is replaced by `setCsvControl($delimiter, $enclosure)`.
53: Method `Symfony\Component\Translation\Loader\CsvFileLoader::setCsvControl()` is replaced by `setCsvControl($delimiter, $enclosure)`.
54: Method `Symfony\Component\Translation\Loader\CsvFileLoader::setCsvControl()` is replaced by `setCsvControl($delimiter, $enclosure)`.
71: Method `Symfony\Component\Translation\TranslatableMessage::__toString()` is replaced by `getMessage()`.
72: Method `Symfony\Component\Translation\TranslatableMessage::__toString()` is replaced by `getMessage()`.
77: Class `Symfony\Component\Translation\Test\ProviderFactoryTestCase` is removed: extend `Symfony\Component\Translation\Test\AbstractProviderFactoryTestCase`, which has no mock getters; use `IncompleteDsnTestTrait` for `incompleteDsnProvider()`, since symfony/translation 7.2.
